  "goodToKnow": "Der Stammspieler (die Stammspielerin) is a regular, first-team player, as opposed to der Ersatzspieler or Reservist. The regular line-up is die Stammelf. Stamm- often means regular: der Stammkunde (regular customer), der Stammtisch (regulars' table at a pub), das Stammlokal (local). Der Stamm is a tree trunk or tribe. The plural is the same: die Stammspieler."
